        "note": "Minimal reproduction of tls1_process_heartbeat: payload (a 16-bit peer length) bytes are copied from the record pl, which holds only rrec_length. Upstream fix adds `1+2+payload+16 > rrec.length`; state C uses the overflow-safe `rrec_length >= 19 && payload <= rrec_length - 19`."
